# Overpass Shoal (CIPlay overpass_shoal): the ramp top, the toll booth log, the sunken lane's air pocket, the van's
# glovebox (the booth key), the booth's strongbox (refused without the key is not tested here: the key comes first),
# the bus locker.
island Overpass Shoal
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Drowned Highway
zone ramp_top
expect step 1
read Toll booth log
expect step 2
zone sunken_lane
air sunken_lane
expect step 3
open Van glovebox
wait 3
expect story boothkey 1
expect step 4
open Toll booth strongbox
wait 3
expect step 5
zone op_ridge
expect step 6
zone op_cave
expect step 7
read Toll keeper's tally
expect step 8
read Caravan diary
expect step 9
open Bus locker
wait 3
expect done
